    "_note": "HELLO prints STRATEGIC SIMULATIONS PRESENTS / VERSION 1.0 (text page, ROM font) and runs INTRO, which loads SHAPES and INFO, RECALLs HPIC onto hi-res page 1, shows it full-screen (lines 1000-1010) and waits for a key (1276); then the PHANTASIE / 1 - START IN PELNOR / 2 - CONTINUE text menu. Shown: HPIC until a key.",
